WEBVTT

00:08:28.921 --> 00:08:30.798
you will remember from the beginning.

00:08:30.839 --> 00:08:33.425
So we really need to know
the beneficiaries

00:08:33.425 --> 00:08:34.802
that we are trying to serve.

00:08:34.802 --> 00:08:37.888
And now you are thinking,
"This sounds very obvious,"

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.139
but it's not done.

00:08:40.099 --> 00:08:43.602
And the third step, of course,
is to know the procedures.

00:08:44.395 --> 00:08:47.690
How will we give this budget out,
who will have access?

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.900
What will be the excluded groups?

00:08:50.317 --> 00:08:51.610
And that's it.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:56.282
And now, I will just share
some good news, I think.

00:08:56.282 --> 00:08:59.410
It's that around 80 countries
around the world

00:08:59.451 --> 00:09:01.412
are working with gender budgeting.